532	     * Returns the number of owners sharing the given {@code householdId} (the household's size),
533	     * counting every existing owner that carries the same {@code householdId}. Returns {@code 0} when
534	     * {@code householdId} is {@code null}, since an owner with no postcode has no household key and so
